ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Ming is a big liar. Xiao Ming's brother, Xiao Yang, secretly knows that Xiao Ming is a big liar, but Xiao Ming thinks he can escape punishment for anything! Yesterday, Xiao Ming steals Xiao Yang's ping pong paddle, Xiao Yang knows where Xiao Ming hides it, but he cannot find it. He is very angry. So he finds Xiao Ming and says: \"Where is my paddle? You must hide it in the cabinet or under the bed, because I search everywhere else. Where is it? In the cabinet or under the bed?\" Xiao Ming tells him the paddle is under the bed.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Yang want to look for the paddle in the cabinet?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. He wants to verify Xiao Ming's words.\nB. Xiao Ming is a big liar, he doesn't believe Xiao Ming's words, so he wants to look in the cabinet.\nC. Because he knows the paddle is in the cabinet, he sees it before.\nD. He knows the paddle is not under the bed, because he has searched there","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.110290147742284E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b07c2ddb05a7fe2f6b6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452231128,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2fe01bc00886479ba08a6fbd2d00e365"}